{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0134_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ebf6e7e4eb34e615a5d04cb90248763bc372191d3ce771ff981c89975fa33cc8", "ja": "今日は好きなだけ、茜ちゃんをナデナデしていいよ！\nこんなチャンスめったにないからね！　うれしいよね！", "zh": "今天你可以尽情对小茜摸摸头！\n这种机会可是很少有的呢！开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0134_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7f433239207a7ff8cdb220ab8d57dbfaad0625bb8597a2642b91924a42a26812", "ja": "ああ、うん。でも、いつもと変わらないような……？\nというか、特別って、何かあったのか？", "zh": "啊，嗯，不过，好像跟平常没什么不同……？\n而且你说「特别」，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0134_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "547e8a0cec184197a93c2842fe4b210c70e84c65dcf7ece679ac564b2db569de", "ja": "も～、{$P$}ちゃん、照れてるの？\nとぼけなくてもいいんだよ！", "zh": "真是的～小{$P$}在害羞吗？\n不用装傻没关系的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0134_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "40b060cad6bf7527c77fe2c90ab193cb3078e2b16f6956d6ff87b201c16264c3", "ja": "茜ちゃんには、何もかもお見通しだからね！\n{$P$}ちゃんの真意とかそういうの！", "zh": "因为小茜全都摸得一清二楚了！\n像是小{$P$}的真实想法之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0134_1007_p", "source_sha256": "656dd887c9118744096033abb2ec1080f691269619669c3c552c35d5e52fd83e", "ja": "真意……？", "zh": "真实想法……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
